  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Preparatory studies to EU4Water and Water TEI</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;Description&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;The Contract main objective is to support the EU Delegation and the Government of Egypt in:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;(i) The definition of strategic priorities to support the water sector in Egypt for the next programming period (2023-2027)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;ii)&amp;nbsp;Conducting a comprehensive study for the potential private sector participation and support local market contarctors in accessing EU co funded projects in Egypt.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;iii)&amp;nbsp;Conducting a comprehensive study for the potential private sector participation under PPP laws in the water sector.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;iv)&amp;nbsp;Identify and formulate a training programme for optimal implementation schemes to increase managment capacities at local and central level and shift the sector towards a demand oriented structure.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
